.\\n*   **Education:** Due to its gentle learning curve, Python is a popular choice for teaching programming at all levels.\\n*   **Business Applications:** Python is also used to build Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and e-commerce systems.\\n\\n### Governance\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\": The Python Software Foundation (PSF)\\n\\nThe Python Software Foundation (PSF) is a non-profit organization that holds the intellectual property rights to the Python language. The PSF's mission is to promote, protect, and advance the Python programming language, and\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\" to support and facilitate the growth of a diverse and international community of Python programmers.\\n\\nThe foundation's responsibilities include:\\n*   Managing the development and release of the CPython reference implementation.\\n*   Organizing PyCon, the official Python conference in the US.\\n*   Awarding grants to\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\" support Python-related projects, conferences, and community events worldwide.\\n*   Maintaining the legal and financial aspects of the language.\\n\\nIn a notable recent decision, the PSF's board unanimously voted to turn down a $1.5 million grant from the U.S. government due to a clause\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\" that would have restricted the foundation's Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) initiatives. This decision highlighted the PSF's commitment to its core values of supporting a diverse community.\\n\\n### Latest Stable Version\\n\\nThe latest stable version of Python is **Python 3.1\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\"4.2**, which was released on December 5, 2025. The major version, Python 3.14, was officially released on October 7, 2025. Active support for this version is planned until October 2\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\"027, with security support extending to October 2030.\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":7,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"Python was conceived in the late 1980s by Guido van Rossum at the Centrum Wiskunde & Informatica (CWI) in the Netherlands.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":8,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"geeksforgeeks.org\",\"data\":\"Python was conceived in the late 1980s by Guido van Rossum at the Centrum Wiskunde & Informatica (CWI) in the Netherlands.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZ1VNgVO__glbcAAi1Rwv3_inmuBnRE2yIMNWDv5S0tfQEzuDCYw0FLO0EBAsDqubfPdyD57JfvaSD8DLsiGEeHOZx7BI59n1SJBWC-xH8WIgkzrKbr3e4IxHbQb_SKFVuu3sKnMppbvao6Abuhg_JzrbggAPoSA==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"Python was conceived in the late 1980s by Guido van Rossum at the Centrum Wiskunde & Informatica (CWI) in the Netherlands.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5pAjxf7keBVjnuKKWfzFQgo7gFVrkDx3GKVWgZW51GmgnaIkB95AYG4vQUskCEJAGilz6Xc74m1X8fzUbvIyZvTfLIo04dBr4BPl0plD6Dnk4YNMl_7pLd_mb\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"Van Rossum began the project as a hobby during his Christmas holidays, intending it to be a successor to the ABC programming language, capable of exception handling and interfacing with the Amoeba operating system.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"geeksforgeeks.org\",\"data\":\"Van Rossum began the project as a hobby during his Christmas holidays, intending it to be a successor to the ABC programming language, capable of exception handling and interfacing with the Amoeba operating system.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZ1VNgVO__glbcAAi1Rwv3_inmuBnRE2yIMNWDv5S0tfQEzuDCYw0FLO0EBAsDqubfPdyD57JfvaSD8DLsiGEeHOZx7BI59n1SJBWC-xH8WIgkzrKbr3e4IxHbQb_SKFVuu3sKnMppbvao6Abuhg_JzrbggAPoSA==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"0, was released in 1991.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"0, was released in 1991.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5pAjxf7keBVjnuKKWfzFQgo7gFVrkDx3GKVWgZW51GmgnaIkB95AYG4vQUskCEJAGilz6Xc74m1X8fzUbvIyZvTfLIo04dBr4BPl0plD6Dnk4YNMl_7pLd_mb\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"The name \\\"Python\\\" was not inspired by the snake, but rather by the British comedy series \\\"Monty Python's Flying Circus,\\\" reflecting van Rossum's desire for a name that was short, unique, and slightly mysterious.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"kochiva.com\",\"data\":\"The name \\\"Python\\\" was not inspired by the snake, but rather by the British comedy series \\\"Monty Python's Flying Circus,\\\" reflecting van Rossum's desire for a name that was short, unique, and slightly mysterious.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVhXPEk5r8_laIByPh3IOb15Zm6u-XQBlImwJFE4la8nO8HKSfdX2XgFaK0vTDJcVfRgN5Fk7c-r7F2v5kVHctOowHJCumM3I18aKQNmvMeuI8I6dn5HVoQpAWYwDXBecjXAkSLGc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"The name \\\"Python\\\" was not inspired by the snake, but rather by the British comedy series \\\"Monty Python's Flying Circus,\\\" reflecting van Rossum's desire for a name that was short, unique, and slightly mysterious.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5pAjxf7keBVjnuKKWfzFQgo7gFVrkDx3GKVWgZW51GmgnaIkB95AYG4vQUskCEJAGilz6Xc74m1X8fzUbvIyZvTfLIo04dBr4BPl0plD6Dnk4YNMl_7pLd_mb\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"For many years, Guido van Rossum led the project as its \\\"Benevolent Dictator for Life\\\" (BDFL), making the final decisions on the language's direction.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"For many years, Guido van Rossum led the project as its \\\"Benevolent Dictator for Life\\\" (BDFL), making the final decisions on the language's direction.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5pAjxf7keBVjnuKKWfzFQgo7gFVrkDx3GKVWgZW51GmgnaIkB95AYG4vQUskCEJAGilz6Xc74m1X8fzUbvIyZvTfLIo04dBr4BPl0plD6Dnk4YNMl_7pLd_mb\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"In July 2018, he announced his \\\"permanent vacation\\\" from this role.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"In January 2019, the Python community elected a five-member Steering Council to lead the project.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"realpython.com\",\"data\":\"The core design principles of Python are encapsulated in \\\"The Zen of Python,\\\" a collection of 19 aphorisms written by longtime Python developer Tim Peters.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE0VwNjAy69DyUUdRd8zK-ZEU84Fapa2Ci6LxcM5ZzCRg0guGbHBEOANskCcZ3eY6qpk24gCADClkYlTxapLQE_2wvFa80w0nVNkAOWcrTAuANGxpWuGV_9er1k2kjc5Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"The core design principles of Python are encapsulated in \\\"The Zen of Python,\\\" a collection of 19 aphorisms written by longtime Python developer Tim Peters.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhvaRAQTo5qdyMt7XVtzdY6GkSMLNpIn2HINRm0UC3Kzxp3gWWpkyEmoMgYrJBhQb0yDMBIxa6L2OAvu0jjCp5jS1xJsNWBvXpF1KHYojpuOkXLQ8riO8Jclbk\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"The core design principles of Python are encapsulated in \\\"The Zen of Python,\\\" a collection of 19 aphorisms written by longtime Python developer Tim Peters.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJgnZ5yqSo3csNGniBqPhwY2g6mT1a7bl9-GLd9mJihznsq0f4O_YPxpZFmqt4vwjtAAgv0p8WDrw5_c9lbBSn_gtcBEACzYTPbUNRtgt90qx2eB1eIiUScDithIkEx4qvp-tDlw==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"