data: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":69,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wscubetech.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Desktop GUI Applications:** As mentioned, Python can be used to create user-friendly desktop applications.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGFyZDIbymRV8qmil68VpdK31G6E_yrrR4X4Ze5ROZwqQHbZL-8a3o_BJLsvGUV4yFmtKiSwJcoJOOuo-Fi_2_ADUkSijZ8s6sIxTuNDTWHV8rTTahwNK7wWCNkenD75NKvjpBGNpN-DC3Xh6Mm_KTk54U=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":70,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mygreatlearning.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Education:** Due to its gentle learning curve, Python is a popular choice for teaching programming at all levels.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEz8F-tzZy19ruongwVOBIx0E_TuCRyT-Sgx-bAwO8rveoIgNYFLq7tmvDr8gMFPiHHMrbtAV9R51rkRvnaJCyd3fzkQg9-F0k7t9WdNq6jOCd6q20a8SUJxKF7rngYwWA0Yt93fTH6o0Hn8BfPUOcS03o7unCVfGKbZkxXalaOhPWOnxFz_o2QnZqfL7lN\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":71,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Business Applications:** Python is also used to build Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and e-commerce systems.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUcJLMoGw3uIU-vmlBRt_XSD2xvCwXGcS4ym-ioIOzeldpqIA-8fqJ1KpV57YsQ81wxlt1Z