llectual property rights to the Python language.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHO11TXRisM6Fc8gnlTe_Gza65fIcMnys6pCOUPiuZrNJUV0xOY05uR9-hafBuZGf_9WNH_9G9LJfX8oUiNeHWXJaLWoHs8h5G-vGUykIZQxt2SROrrfvPy7Wj0C8=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":75,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"The PSF's mission is to promote, protect, and advance the Python programming language, and to support and facilitate the growth of a diverse and international community of Python programmers.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHO11TXRisM6Fc8gnlTe_Gza65fIcMnys6pCOUPiuZrNJUV0xOY05uR9-hafBuZGf_9WNH_9G9LJfX8oUiNeHWXJaLWoHs8h5G-vGUykIZQxt2SROrrfvPy7Wj0C8=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":76,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"python.org\",\"data\":\"*   Awarding grants to support Python-related projects, conferences, and community events worldwide.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHO11TXRisM6Fc8gnlTe_Gza65fIcMnys6pCOUPiuZrNJUV0xOY05uR9-hafBuZGf_9WNH_9G9LJfX8oUiNeHWXJaLWoHs8h5G-vGUykIZQxt2SROrrfvPy7Wj0C8=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"6b48df3d-48c4-46a8-911c-139cb4682a06\",\"created\":1769518774,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"fini